---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="flex flex-col justify-center place-items-center gap-8">
      <div class="flex flex-row gap-10">
        <h1 class="text-5xl font-bold">Study Sidekick</h1>
        <a
          href="https://github.com/locoplains13/StudySidekick"
          class="hover:scale-115 transition-all"
          target="_blank"
        >
          <img src="/github.png" class="w-14" />
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="text-left flex flex-col gap-4 md:max-w-5xl">
        <p>
          This is an application developed in Java using its frameworks for
          making desktop apps JavaFx
        </p>
        <p>
          My university team and I worked on it throughout the entire semester,
          in which we all managed to design and develop the multiple views of
          the app. It uses a MVC (Model View Controller) architecture. We
          designed multiple UML diagrams for the scripts. I played a part in
          designing the calendar and the timer systems
        </p>
        <p>
          The app, as you can see, has a calendar at the homepage to choose
          which day of the week, and a checklist to see which tasks are due for
          the day. There is also a timer that appears whenever you click on
          start a task and takes you back to the homepage to keep track of which
          tasks you still have left to do. You can also edit the app's settings
          so the app can alert you at some point about any tasks that are due
          later.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section flex justify-center place-items-center">
    <div class="carousel md:max-w-5xl w-full">
      <div id="item1" class="carousel-item w-full">
        <img src="/img1.png" class="w-full" />
      </div>
      <div id="item2" class="carousel-item w-full">
        <img src="/img2.png" class="w-full" />
      </div>
      <div id="item3" class="carousel-item w-full">
        <img src="/img3.png" class="w-full" />
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="flex w-full justify-center gap-2 py-2">
      <a href="#item1" class="btn btn-xs">1</a>
      <a href="#item2" class="btn btn-xs">2</a>
      <a href="#item3" class="btn btn-xs">3</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
